    "description": "Title:\nMixed Mineral and Gemstone Rough and Specimen Lot\nColor:\nMulti-Color\nCategory:\nJewelry & Watches\nGemstone Color:\nMulti-Color\nGemstone Creation:\nNatural\nGemstone Form:\nRough & Specimen\nGemstone Shape:\nRough/Specimen\nGemstone Treatment:\nUntreated\nGemstone Type:\nMixed Minerals and Gemstones\nNumber Of Pieces:\n18\nTransparency:\nVaried\nUnit Quantity:\n1\nUnit Type:\nUnit\nDescription:\nDiscover a curated collection of 18 natural mineral and gemstone specimens, perfect for collectors, crafters, or educational use. This lot includes a diverse array of rough and raw minerals, with visible variations in color, luster, and texture, ranging from milky whites and pastels to vibrant greens and deep blacks. Each specimen is natural and untreated, showcasing the beauty and uniqueness of earth's geology. The set features large specimen rocks, translucent crystals, and smaller gemstone fragments, ideal for display, study, or metaphysical purposes. These samples offer both visual appeal and scientific interest, making them an excellent addition to any mineral collection or a thoughtful gift for a geology enthusiast. All pieces are sold as shown and have not been altered or treated. Enjoy the satisfaction of adding genuine raw mineral beauty to your collection, ready to inspire curiosity and admiration.",
